msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:5
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"While slow on the attack, axes do a lot of damage when they hit.  Expert axe"
" fighters gain a little more speed on their attacks while master axe "
"fighters can deliver extra damage."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:5
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Chance to halve the Armor Class of the target."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:6
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"The spear skill allows use of bladed pole weapons. Expert spearmen strike "
"for greater damage, and masters can wield spears in one hand."
msgstr ""

