"Fate can be used on a character to increase his chance to hit, or on a "
"monster to decrease its chance.  The chance is modified by 20 + 1 per point "
"of skill in Spirit Magic, and lasts until the target attacks, or 5 minutes "
"go by."
msgstr ""

