msgstr "Resucitar muertos"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:59
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Raises a character from the dead if you cast this spell in time.  The "
"greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer a character can have "
"been dead before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only "
"way to raise the character short of Divine Intervention is to visit a "
"temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr ""

