msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Resurrects a character whose body has been destroyed.  Recovery rate is very"
" slow, but will be faster for characters with a higher skill in Spirit "
"Magic.  The resurrected character will be in a weak condition after this "
"spell is cast."
msgstr ""

