"Fires a bolt of mental force which damages a single target's nervous system."
"  Mind Blast does 3 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Mind "
"Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:362
