#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1317
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:516
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Might +150, Intellect -40, Personality -40, Speed -40) It is said that Mash"
" was the answer to the First Ogre's prayer to the Gods for a weapon that "
"would make it stronger than anything else.  Annoyed, the Gods cursed the "
"First Ogre with Mash, and all Ogres have since borne the mark of that act--"
"strong, but slow, dull, and stupid.  In any event, Mash is yours now."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1318
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:517
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ethric's Staff"
msgstr "Bastón de Ethric"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1318
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:517
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Of Dark Magic, Meditation skill +15, Decrease Hit Points over time, Evil) "
"Much more a tool than a weapon, Ethric's Staff was fashioned by the world's "
"first lich--Ethric the Mad.  The staff magnifies Dark magic, drawing from "
"the life force of its user.  Since Ethric's life force was magically "
"sustained, this wasn't a problem for him.  Mortals, however, will slowly "
"feel their life force drain away while they hold the staff."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1319
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:518
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hareck's Leather"
msgstr "Cuero de Hareck"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1319
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:518
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Stealing skill +5, Disarm skill +5, Water Walking, Luck +50, All "
"Resistances -10)This leather armor was specially built by the Regnan armory "
"for Hareck the First, Lord of Regna, and Emperor of the Endless Ocean.  The "
"armor did everything a glorified pirate like Hareck could hope for, except "
"protect him from poison.  The mighty first Emperor of Regna died just after "
"dinner while wearing the armor, poisoned by his wife's hand. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1320
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:519
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Old Nick"
msgstr "Viejo Nick"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1320
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:519
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Disarm Skill +5, 8 points of Poison damage, Elf Slaying, Evil) Secretly "
"passed from one Assassin to another for centuries, Old Nick happily vanished"
" from history's sight during the Battle for Morning--a joint Human-Elvish "
"attack on the Assassin's guild nearly 200 years ago.  It is said that Old "
"Nick has killed more people than the Plague.  Now that you've found this "
"evil weapon, you're going to throw it down a well...aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1321
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:520
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Amuck"
msgstr "Amuck"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1321
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:520
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Might +100, Endurance +100, Armor Class -15) The original name of Amuck has"
" been lost in time, but the blade retains a magically keen edge and all of "
"its original power.  Fantastic strength and vitality are conferred upon the "
"owner at the expense of a proper sense of fear.  Wielders of Amuck don't "
"much bother dodging blows in battle."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1322
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:521
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Glory Shield"
msgstr "Escudo de la Gloria"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1322
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:521
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Of Spirit Magic, Shield skill +5, Body Resistance -10, Mind Resistance -10)"
" One of five such shields known to exist, the Glory Shield was built during "
"the Time of Wonders.  It was especially tuned to promote Spirit magic, but "
"that same attunement leaves the wielder somewhat open to Mind and Body based"
" attacks."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1323
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:522
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Kelebrim"
msgstr "Kelebrim"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1323
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:522
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Immunity to stone condition, Half damage from missile attacks, Endurance "
"+50, Earth Resistance -30) One of the first shields to issue from the "
"Kelebrim Foundry, this one bears the simple stamp \"Kelebrim\" on the inside"
" under the hand strap.  It has very powerful enchantments meant to protect "
"from Medusa gazes, but like many grand enchantments, it comes with a flaw.  "
"Kelebrim weakens it's owners resistance to Earth magic."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1324
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:523
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Taledon's Helm"
msgstr "Yelmo de Taledon"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1324
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:523
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Of Light Magic, Personality +15, Might +15, Luck -40, Good)Owned by "
"Taledon, Divine High Priest and High Holy Conduit of the Church of the Sun "
"from 870 A.S., this powerful helm probably contributed to his untimely death"
" in 881.  It is said that an object may take so much enchantment--try to put"
" too much in, and something negative squeezes out.  In this case, the "
"negative made the wearer profoundly unlucky.  Taledon, arguably the most "
"powerful figure of his time, veteran diplomat, soldier, and priest, was "
"crushed beneath the wheels of a runaway peasant's wagon while crossing the "
"street in Steadwick."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1325
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:524
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Scholar's Cap"
msgstr "Gorro del erudito"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1325
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:524
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Learning skill +15, Endurance -50) The Scholar's Cap vastly improves the "
"ability of the mind to absorb and retain experiences.  The effect is so "
"intense that wearers frequently forget to care for their bodies while "
"swimming in the sea of their thoughts.  "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1326
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:525
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Phynaxian Crown"
msgstr "Corona de Phynaxia"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1326
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:525
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Of Fire Magic, Water Resistance +50, Personality +30, Armor Class -20) This"
" is the lost (WAS the lost) crown of the short lived Empire of Phynax.  When"
" worn, the crown's jewels smolder with   barely restrained Fire magic, and "
"cast reddish light upon the face of the wearer.  The crown amplifies any "
"skill in Fire magic the wearer may have, and fiercely resists water based "
"attacks."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1327
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:526
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Titan's Belt"
msgstr "Cinturón del Titán"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1327
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:526
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Might +75, Speed -40) Like so many similar items, the Titan's Belt "
"increases the might of its wearer at the expense of speed.  The only "
"difference with this relic is the magnitude of the trade off."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1328
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:527
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Twilight"
msgstr "Crepúsculo"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1328
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:527
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Speed +50, Luck +50, All resistances -15, Evil) The sinister Twilight Cloak"
" has been used by spies and assassins for centuries.  The nature of the "
"enchantment is so beneficial to those professions that the loss of magical "
"resistance is easily overlooked."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:528
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ania Selving"
msgstr "Ania Selving"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:528
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Accuracy +150, Bow skill +5, Armor Class -25) Master smith Ivan Selving "
"named this crossbow after his only daughter Ania, calling it his second best"
" creation ever.  Archers using this crossbow rarely miss their targets, but "
"their concentration and slow, careful movements make them easy targets in "
"turn."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:529
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Justice"
msgstr "Justicia"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:529
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Undead slaying, of Mind magic, of Body magic, -40 Speed, Good) Forged in "
"the halcyon days at the beginning of the Church of the Sun, Justice is a "
"powerful weapon for Good.  At the cost of a speed, Justice is one of the "
"mightiest relics a Paladin or Cleric can wield for the Path of Light."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:530
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mekorig's Hammer"
msgstr "Martillo de Mekorig"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:530
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Of Spirit magic, Might +75, Air Resistance -50) This is the very hammer the"
" great Mekorig the Blind used to turn out so much of the world's finest "
"enchanted equipment during his many years as Master of the Mekorig Foundry."
"  The hammer's connection to the elements leaves the wielder vulnerable to "
"elemental magic, but it is a small price to pay for the enhanced Self "
"ability and Might the hammer provides."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1332
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:531
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hermes' Sandals"
msgstr "Sandalias de Hermes"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1332 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1440
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:531
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:639
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sandals"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1332
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:531
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(+100 Speed, +50 Accuracy, +50 Air Resistance, Regenerate HP, Regenerate SP,"
" Feather Falling) Rumored to be the footwear of a god, the winged sandals "
"confer enormous power on the wearer."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:532
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cloak of the Sheep"
msgstr "Capa de la Oveja"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:532
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Immunity to disease, insanity, paralysis, poison, sleep, and stone "
"conditions, Intellect -20, Personality -20) The cloak worn by the High "
"Priest of Baa, though useful it seems to sap the will of the wearer slowly "
"away."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:533
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elfbane"
msgstr "Perdición de los Elfos"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1334
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Artifact Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:533
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Of Shielding, Elf Slayer, Goblin) This sword was created by the goblins for"
" their Chief at the time, Grogar.  Unfortunately, the goblins lost the war "
"and Elfbane was lost for quite some time.  Enchanted to both slay elves, and"
" protect its wielder from arrows, Elfbane truly lives up to its name.  A "
"curious side effect of the enchantment renders the weapon unusable by all "
"but a goblin."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1335
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:534
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mind's Eye"
msgstr "Ojo de la mente"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1335
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:534
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(+15 Intellect, +15 Personality, Regenerate SP, Human) Mind's Eye was "
"created by Mekorig for the Great Druid, Larette Weisman.  While enhancing "
"both intellect and personality, Mind's Eye regenerates the wearer's mana and"
" also provides head protection.  Unfortunately, Mind's Eye will only fit on "
"the head of a human."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:535
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Chainmail"
msgstr "Cota de malla élfica"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1336
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Artifact Chain Mail"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:535
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(of Recovery, +15 Speed, +15 Accuracy, Elven) Elven chainmail was more "
"common before the wars against the humans and the goblins.  Centuries of "
"combat combined with the degradation of armorsmithing skills have reduced "
"the number of sets of Elven Chainmail to almost none.  The effect of using "
"lighter materials and custom designing the armor to only fit elves grants "
"the wearer more freedom of movement, allowing faster, more accurate attacks."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:536
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Forge Gauntlets"
msgstr "Guanteletes de la Forja"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:536
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(+30 Fire Resistance, +15 Might, +15 Endurance, Dwarven) Forge Gauntlets "
"were created by Mekorig for his assistants to aid them in helping him.  "
"Extending the already amazing dwarven might and endurance, the gauntlets "
"also grant exceptional resistance to fire-- necessary in a forge as hot as "
"Mekorig's."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1338
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:537
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hero's Belt"
msgstr "Cinturón del héroe"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1338
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Artifact Belt"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1338
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:537
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(+5 Armsmaster skill, +15 Might, Regenerate HP, Male) Designed for Saint "
"Perci, this belt confers martial prowess, exceptional strength, and "
"regeneration.  Saint Perci used the belt quite extensively, but even with "
"its help he wasn't able to stave off death at the hands of the Wromthrax the"
" dragon."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:538
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lady's Escort"
msgstr "Escolta de la dama"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:538
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"(Water walking, Feather falling, of Protection, Female) A magical 'escort' "
"designed by the mage Terrax for one of his female friends who had to travel "
"quite far to reach him.  The ring protects the wearer from elements, "
"falling, and drowning.  Unfortunately, she traveled to Erathia and the ring "
"disappeared soon after."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:539
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Clanker's Amulet"
msgstr "Amuleto de Clanker"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1340 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1342
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Amulet"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:539
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A mighty tool for alchemists, this amulet was the secret to Clanker's "
"success.  "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:540
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lieutenant's Cutlass"
msgstr "Alfanje de teniente"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1341 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1355
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Cutlass"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:540
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A fine steel weapon, this cutlass is sharpened and ready for action."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:541
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Medusa's Mirror"
msgstr "Espejo de Medusa"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:541
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The user of this mirror is completely immune to stoning effects.  Would have"
" been nice to have this earlier.  "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:542
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lady Carmine's Dagger"
msgstr "Daga de la dama Carmine"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1343
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Dagger"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:542
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Nicks and scratches on this nasty blade show that it has seen plenty of "
"action.  "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:543
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Villain's Blade"
msgstr "Hoja del Villano"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1344
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Sword"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:543
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"William Setag would frequently slay prisoners with this blade to heal his "
"own minor cuts and bruises.  The weapon is cold to the touch, and tingles in"
" your hand."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1345 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:544
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Perfect Bow"
msgstr "El arco perfecto"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1345
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:544
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  Although of high quality, this bow doesn't seem to perform "
"nearly as well as it should.  The string is too hard to pull back, it "
"doesn't remain steady enough while aiming, and it seems a little off-"
"balance."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This bow seems to know its wielder's strength and adjusts itself "
"accordingly.  You never have to struggle to pull the string back, and it's "
"always easy to hold your shot until you're ready to fire.  Dozens of small "
"advantages like this in the design of the bow make for the finest weapon of "
"its type you have ever seen."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1347
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:546
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shadow's Mask"
msgstr "Máscara de las sombras"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1347
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Helm"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1347
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:546
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A mask designed to hide the identity of the wearer, it has also been "
"magically enhanced to offer good protection and to aid thiefly pursuits."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1348
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:547
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ghost Ring"
msgstr "Anillo del Fantasma"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1348
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:547
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"An odd ring that feels strangely warm to the touch.  It enhances the wearers"
" connection to the spirit."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:548
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Faerie Ring"
msgstr "Anillo de las hadas"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:548
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A rare and very powerful ring made by Faeries.  Few mortals ever see such as"
" this!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:549
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sun Cloak"
msgstr "Capa del sol"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1350 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1351 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1353
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Cloak"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:549
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This cloak signifies the highest rank attainable by a Priest of the Sun.  No"
" more than nine of these cloaks were ever made--one for each member of the "
"High Council of the Sun."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:550
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Moon Cloak"
msgstr "Capa lunar"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:550
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"This cloak signifies the highest rank attainable by a Priest of the Moon.  "
"No more than nine of these cloaks were ever made--one for each member of the"
" High Council of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:551
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Zokarr's Axe"
msgstr "Hacha de Zokarr"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:551
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"The family heirloom of the Zokarr monarchs.  This weapon grants the wielder "
"a greater affinity with earth magic."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:552
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vampire's Cape"
msgstr "Capa del vampiro"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:552
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Small wonder such a cloak as this would be found on a vampire.  The cloak "
"prevents sunlight from reaching the body, but is unable to protect the face."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:553
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur's Axe"
msgstr "Hacha del minotauro"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1354
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Axe"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:553
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A fine trophy!  The axe is made for a Minotaur and is very heavy, but the "
"magical strength it imparts makes it easy to use for anyone."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1355
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:554
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Grognard's Cutlass"
msgstr "Alfanje de Grognard"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1355
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:554
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A finely crafted and specially enchanted goblin weapon.  Though originally "
"crafted to slay elves, this weapon does a perfectly good job on members of "
"the other races."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1373
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:572
