#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:2
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:2
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Vampire crypts are normally well hidden. That the Shadowspire vampires "
"operate so openly is proof of their power in the region."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:3
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:3
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A burial mound. Though obviously centuries old, the door's inlaid and gilded"
" decorations are clean and untarnished. They must be preserved by magic."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:4
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"When he passed away, Lord Brinne was mourned throughout the land. His tomb "
"is a holy place visited by pilgrims and other well-wishers."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:5
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "You find a passage leading downwards. Do you enter?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:6
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The volcano has apparently pulled this ancient building from the bottom of "
"the sea. Who were it's mysterious builders?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:7
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Alvarian Dark Dwarves are recent arrivals to the area. In a short time, "
"however, they've built an extensive system of mines."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:8
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:2
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  The dead "
"bodies near his home might have been adventurers seeking the dragon's "
"treasure."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:9
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The enormous size and lavish decoration of Lord Markham's Manor provide a "
"striking contrast to the humble peasant homes and huts nearby."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:10
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"From the looks of the trash and decaying garbage on the ground outside, many"
" generations of bandits have used this cave to hide from the law."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:11
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Once a stately mansion, this old house has long been abandoned by the "
"original owners.  The current residents don't seem to keep the place up very"
" well."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:12 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:13 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:14 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:230
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:6
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:7
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The entrance to this barrow is pleasing to the eye, yet at the same time "
"forbidding.  The air is very quiet near the entrance."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The door is unlocked and unguarded from the outside.  The iron on the "
"doorknob is rusting, and you can see a small hornet's nest in the corner "
"above the door."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:16
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A nasty odor wafts from the entrance of this cave, propelled by an unseen "
"subterranean breeze.  It smells like decaying meat mixed with brimstone "
"and…peppermint?  Whatever.  Looks dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:17
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The unassuming home of someone unimportant…or, at least someone who wishes "
"to appear that way."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:12
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This tomb must be the resting place of an eccentric recluse.  The tomb "
"doesn't appear to have been disturbed in quite some time."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:19
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:2
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  The undead "
"near his home might have been adventurers seeking the dragon's treasure."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:20
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:3
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The faint smell of brimstone and the sound of creatures talking in a strange"
" language drift from the entrance of this cave."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:21 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:159
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:222
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"As you go deeper into this vast network of tunnels, your instinct tells you "
"that many dangerous creatures dwell within. You vow to remain vigilant."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:23 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:158
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:221
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A thunderous howl pierces your ears, provoking a feeling of dread. Whatever "
"produced that sound is drawing near, with each step rocking the earth "
"beneath your feet."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:26 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:42
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:154
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:154
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Regent Wilbur Humphrey, Foremost Paladin, and Prince Nicolai Ironfist, heir "
"to the throne of Enroth, both reside in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:27 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:43
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:156
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:156
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Lord Albert Newton, High Sorcerer of Enroth, resides in Castle Newton."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:28 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:44
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:158
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:158
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Lord Osric Temper, Foremost Knight, resides in Castle Temper."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:29 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:45
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:160
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:160
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Lord Anthony Stone, High Priest of Free Haven, resides in Castle Stone."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:30 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:46
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:162
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:162
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Lady Loretta Fleise, Chancellor of the Treasury, resides in Castle Fleise."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:31 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:47
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:164
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:164
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Lord Eric von Stromgard, Marquis of the Northern Marches, resides in Castle "
"Stromgard."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:32 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:36
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:166
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:166
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Oracle has provided the rulers of Enroth with wisdom for as long as "
"anyone can remember."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:455
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The maelstrom energies of air magic hold together an egg of cloud mist. You "
"can hear a faint but clearly angry howling coming from the strange "
"structure."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:456
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Though the air temperature is quite warm, this pod of ice does not melt. The"
" elemental power of water magic swirls about it, keeping it winter cold. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:50
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:457
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Forces of fire magic heat this cylinder of iron to red hot heat. The hiss of"
" steam makes you wonder if the thing is full of boiling water."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:500
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"After you rescued them, the Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair built a new entrance"
" to their city."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:52 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:155
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:245
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:501
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The back door to the mysterious abandoned temple built by the race which "
"lived on Dagger Wound before the Lizardmen--it should be safe now, right?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:192
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"History holds that Lizardmen temples of this period were guarded by traps "
"and not monsters. What then to make of the reptilian slithering receding "
"into the darkness?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:223
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"You see no solid ground in the airy realm through this gateway. In the hazy "
"distance you can see oddly shaped buildings that seem to float in the sky."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:224
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Looking through the gateway is like peering through a window into an "
"underwater canyon. Creatures of all sizes swim menacingly in the distance."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:193
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The smell of freshly lumbered wood gives indication of this fort's recent "
"construction. The large stacks of supplies show that the Regnan pirates are "
"planning a lengthy stay."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:221
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Though the view is obscured by shimmering waves of heated air, through the "
"gateway you perceive a hellish landscape of endless bridgeways spanning an "
"ocean of lava."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:58
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:194
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Even in the freeport of Ravenshore, some goods must avoid official eyes. "
"Such usually pass through this secluded cove in the care of the wererat "
"smugglers."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:222
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The gateway leads to an earthen tunnel which extends a few paces then tees "
"off left and right. You can't say where the passages lead."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:195
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"By the number of wolf tracks marking the approach to this wolves' den, "
"either the wolves are extremely active or hundreds of them live in these "
"caves."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:196
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Dark Elven Merchants of Alvar run a mighty trade empire spanning the "
"reach of Jadame. This is their local guildhouse in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:62
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:197
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"From the conflux key come a keening pitch which resonates through the "
"crystal. A hidden depth is revealed--a passage that draws you with "
"inexplicable attraction."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:198
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The hive emits a hum which sets your teeth rattling in your jaw. The breeze "
"you feel is not the wind, but the blowback of a thousand monstrous wings."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:199
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Ogre armies need carry no winches to their fort building sites. Their "
"strength of arm and back is sufficient to raise the massive beams and posts."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:200
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Trolls of Rust have entombed their dead here for centuries--each "
"generation digging deeper catacombs beneath those dug before."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:201
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"What use do the Cyclopes make of this sinister vault? Whatever they do, "
"makes it smell like a butcher's shop."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:202
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A tunnel of solidified lava snakes downward. Can it possible provide safe "
"passage beneath the lake of fire?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:203
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Made ruin in some long forgotten war, parts of this castle are still whole. "
"The dragon hunters have made good use of these."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:204
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"By nature, dragons are solitary beings. Occasionally, a few will nest "
"together, but here in Garrote Gorge they have built a mighty society."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:205
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The stonework façade of this ancient temple has crumbled into the sand of "
"time. Still, its majesty--and mystery--remain."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:206
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Though this temple is newly built it already possesses a timeless quality."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:207
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The dark rock of these stone monuments cannot be found nearby. The nearest "
"source is the Shadowspire Mountains a hundred leagues away."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:208
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This air vent seems to be the only entrance into the flooded Minotaur city, "
"Balthazar Lair."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:209
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Zog the Jackal's preference for building on high ground has provided an "
"unexpected boon in the form of protection from the raging flood waters."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:210
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Regnans have never been known for their subtlety. This thick walled and "
"cannon studded castle is the very definition of 'forbidding.'"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:211
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"From a distance, this moss covered and crumbling stronghold seems long "
"abandoned. Fresh boot prints in the mud and the signal mirror tell a "
"different story."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:212
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This strange craft seems capable of traveling both on and under the water's "
"surface. A series of cranks operated the wheel of blades which propel it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:213
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Brooding over the village below, the Necromancers' Guild exudes an "
"atmosphere of domineering evil."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:214
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Though renown for her beauty, Zanthora's madness drives her to live apart "
"from the company of others. In this forbidding castle she conducts her dark "
"experiments."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:80 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:215
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"All buildings in the Plane of Air float. So why does this cloud castle seem "
"particularly incongruous? Perhaps because its great size?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:216
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Tribute Tomb"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:217
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Not a stick of wood or other combustibles are visible in the walls and "
"towers of this mighty keep of stone and iron."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:84
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:218
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"If there were any doubts of the Fire Elementals' hostile intentions towards "
"Jadame, they are allayed by the presence of this rallying camp. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:219
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Destroyer reigns from a macabre palace. What kind of being would choose "
"to live inside the skull of a 400 foot tall giant?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:86
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:220
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The magic power of earth whirls around this cocoon-like encasement of earth "
"and rock. A cry of torment like a dying wind issues from within."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:87 mmmerge/Data/Text
#: localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:94
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:174
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:194
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The front door to your new home stands before you."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:88
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:176
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The grand entrance to Castle Gryphonheart stands before you.  A pair of tame"
" griffins can frequently be seen circling above the castle."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:89
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:178
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Castle Navan is the traditional seat of Elvish power.  Centuries of plant "
"growth around the castle contribute to its sylvan character."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:90
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:180
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Who knows why the Necromancers felt the need to build a castle deep within "
"the bowels of the earth?  Castle Gloaming is ugly, sinister, and very, very "
"secure."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:91
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:182
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Floating above most clouds gives Castle Lambent more sunlight per year than "
"any other location.  The elegant architecture takes full advantage of the "
"weather."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:92
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:192
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The dripping of water and a strange, unidentifiable squeaking are the only "
"noises that seem to come from the entrance to this cave."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:93
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:193
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  Perhaps this "
"is where those missing adventurers are..."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:95
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:195
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"These caves are the traditional hideout of goblins and bandits.  Whatever "
"lives there now doesn't make the place smell too good…"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:96
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:196
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Foul water pours from a large drain pipe coming from the Erathian Sewer.  It"
" is said the Thieves' Guild can be found in here."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:97
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:197
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This mighty fort does a superb job guarding the East Bridge from invaders.  "
"It doesn't look like visitors are welcome inside the fort."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:98
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:198
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Fresh human or elvish footprints lead into this cave, and weeds and brush "
"have been cleared from the entrance recently."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:99
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:199
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Faint sounds of distant explosions and mad laughter can be heard from beyond"
" the door.  There is a sharp, acidic smell in the air."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:100
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:200
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A frightening spectacle of shadowy claws and twisted demonic figures beckons"
" you inside.  You can hear a woman singing in the distance, but can't quite "
"make out the words."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:101
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:201
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The last of a series of watchtowers that once guarded the border of Deyja, "
"Watchtower 6 is battle scarred, but still standing tall."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:102
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:202
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The sharp, electric smell of magic fills the air outside the School--the "
"result of hundreds of years of magical experiments and juvenile pranks "
"happening in the same building."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:103
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:203
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Though recently abandoned by the Dwarves, you can still easily see the craft"
" and care they put into this mine."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:104
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:204
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The proving grounds of the Wizards, the Walls of Mist floats on the clouds "
"like a mirage of the sky.  It is an entirely magical construct."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:105
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:205
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Temple of the Light is one of the most beautiful and serene places in "
"the world.  Any follower of the Light can feel their troubles slipping away "
"as they walk in these hallowed halls."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:106
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:206
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Traitors and prisoners of war are frequently thrown in this horrible pit as "
"object lessons in cruelty.  All Necromancers must also enter the pit and "
"escape before they can complete their apprenticeships."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:107
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:207
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Temple of the Dark is still in use by the forces of evil.  Sacrifices "
"are held monthly, and foul rites are performed routinely on the front steps."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:108
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:208
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The sound of unholy chanting and the screams and moans of the undead can be "
"heard quite clearly from the entrance.  "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:109
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:209
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Overgrown and weather beaten, the Grand Temple of the Sun has seen better "
"days.  It appears someone is still taking care of the place."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:110
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:210
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Warlocks of Nighon call this extinct volcano their home.  A network of "
"natural and carved tunnels spread away from the mountain, permitting travel "
"throughout Nighon and across the sea."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:111
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:211
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A huge, magical maze stretches before you as far as the eye can see.  "
"Looking at it for long dazzles the eyes and confuses the mind."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:112
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:212
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Stone City is one of the great bastions of the Dwarven race in the world.  "
"The front gate looks very secure."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:113
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:213
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Words cannot convey the horror.  One of the pipes must be an entrance…"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:114
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:214
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Mercenary Guild is home to every swordsman who fails at banditry.  "
"Visitors are unwelcome."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:115
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:215
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"These caverns have been the hideout of pirates and ne'er-do-wells for "
"centuries."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:116
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:216
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A trail of ominous brown stains leads downstairs and into darkness…"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:117
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:217
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A mighty fortress housing the fantastic and murderous Titans.  No one has "
"ever entered and returned to tell the tale."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:118
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:218
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Once the proud center of a false religion, the Temple has fallen into "
"disrepair.  "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:119
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:219
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"It doesn't look like much, but getting in isn't easy.  Careful not to stray "
"from the path."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:120
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:220
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This incredible starship is but a small sample of the wonders of the "
"Ancients."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:121
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:172
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The weathered stones of this old keep shelter empty buildings in an unused "
"courtyard.  Faint sounds echo from a worn stairway that leads down below the"
" keep."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:122
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:192
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Faint chanting can be heard from beyond the doors of this Temple.  Visitors "
"do not appear to be welcome here."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:123
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:200
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The first fortress dedicated to magical research, its remote location "
"provided secrecy for the mages and protection for the populace in the event "
"of an accident."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:124
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:203
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This pyramid seems to be made of a strange, weathered metal.  It appears to "
"be partially buried in the sand."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:125
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:204
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This strange structure commands a spectacular view of Paradise Valley.  The "
"outer walls are constructed from an unknown material."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:126
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:173
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Strange squeaking echoes from behind the front doors.  At one time a temple "
"of Baa, a foul curse caused the old inhabitants to move away."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:127
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:193
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This large but simple structure has become the center of worship for a small"
" religious group called the Order of the Fist."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:128
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:201
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The temperature drops as you approach the gates to this castle.  Legend "
"holds that this castle contains the knowledge of how to transcend death as "
"undead."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:129
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:174
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This area appears to be abandoned.  However, fresh footprints lead in and "
"out from a recently repaired door.  Perhaps it isn’t so abandoned after all."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:130
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:194
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The smells of death and decay seem to fill the air near this structure.  The"
" temple's original purpose has long since been forgotten by the new "
"worshippers."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:131
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:202
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Kriegspire no longer rests between its lakes, the earth around the castle "
"was raised to prevent the creatures inside from escaping."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:132
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:175
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Ancient runes above the entrance attempt to scare away the casual visitor.  "
"Fresh goblin tracks lead into and out of the doorway."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:133
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:195
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This forgotten shrine of the Church of the Sun still stands.  For all of its"
" time in the humid jungle, the temple remains in surprisingly good "
"condition."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:134
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:176
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"These caverns once belonged to the exiled King Rocklin, but now they are "
"home to the new Dwarven King, Snergle."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:135
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:196
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Originally a place of worship for the Church of the Moon, this old sanctuary"
" is now home to Cedric Drother’s group of Druids."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:136
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:177
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The original name of these caverns has been lost in time.  Now, it is named "
"for the group of bandits that base their operations from it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:137
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:197
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The temperature rises steadily as you approach the doors, the smell of "
"sulfur and ash strong.  This place resembles a hideout more than a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:138
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:178
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This small post acts as an advance base for the Fraternal Order of Silver.  "
"From here, they are able to patrol Mist in their conquest of evil."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:139
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:198
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The focal point of all Baa worship in Enroth, the Superior Temple only "
"allows followers of Baa inside."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:140
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:179
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Home to the so-called Prince of Thieves, the Shadow Guild operates outside "
"of Anthony Stone's jurisdiction.  This Guildhall is not open to the public."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:141
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:199
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The forest of statues scattered about seems to magnify the silence on Star "
"Island.  Certainly, the rumors of medusas living in this temple are true."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:142
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:180
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The largest dwarven mine in Enroth, Snergle has claimed it in his succession"
" to the dwarven throne."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:143
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:181
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Dragoons rebuilt and refurbished this keep to serve as their "
"headquarters.  From here, they prey on traffic to and from Free Haven."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:144
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:182
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Once the residence of Archmage Terrax, Corlagon received the Estate from "
"Archibald for his services during the Succession Wars."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:145
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:183
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The headquarters of the Fraternal Order of Silver and Sir John Silver's "
"home.  Silver Helms from this Stronghold patrol Silver Cove in search of "
"evil."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:146
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:184
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This forboding structure radiates magical power.  Druids from all over "
"Enroth make periodic pilgrimages to visit this sacred place."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:147
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:185
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Ethric, the first Sorcerer seeking life after death, still walks about his "
"tomb, the leader of a host of undead servants.  At least, that’s how the "
"rumor goes..."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:148
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:186
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Originally used to keep creatures from escaping the Frozen Wastelands, now "
"the keep prevents traffic to and from Castle Stromgard and town of White "
"Cap."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:149
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:187
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Muted sounds of clashing metal and loud voices emanate from this imposing "
"fortress.  No one would dare assault the Warlord’s home."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:150
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:188
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A foul smell wafts from the entrance to these caves.  The howl of a wolf can"
" be heard from the distance."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:151
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:189
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"Fire Elementals assisted Gharik in his attempts to create powerful items "
"here.  A handful of his students continue his experiments."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:152
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:190
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This laboratory is the birthplace for countless horrid experiments.  Its "
"remote location was chosen for both safety and secrecy."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:153
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:191
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"These caves house a strange alliance between human warriors and dragons.  "
"The Dragon Towers were built in the towns to ward off these raiders."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:154
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:171
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The Control Center has been closed since the Silence, nearly twelve "
"centuries ago."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:160
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:223
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "This tunnel leads to Stone City."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:195
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"It seems that the entrance does not lead to the Dark Dwarves' Compound."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:196
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Enter basement of The Breach."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:210
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:9
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"This cave is legendary in Trollish lore, and is a holy place. Other "
"creatures, however, might just see it as a lair to occupy and defend."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:212
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:10
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"As with all places holy to the followers of Eep, this temple smells of damp "
"fur and cheese. A chorus of squeaks, like chanting issues from within."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:214
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:11
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"As with all places holy to the followers of Eep, this small temple smells "
"faintly of fur and cheese."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:216
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:12
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A church holy to the followers of Eep. It smells faintly of damp fur and "
"cheese."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:218
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:13
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"A cave entrance. A slight breeze from within brings you the faint smell of "
"brimstone."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:220
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:14
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A cave entrance. The lair of some monstrous beast?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:222
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:15
msgctxt "trans"
msgid ""
"The entrance to this cave has been crudely widened by a creature with claws "
"capable of ripping the hard dark stone."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:262
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:212
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Enter Hive"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:263
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:234
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Enter Castle Ironfist"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:264
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Trans.txt.py:211
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Enter Tomb of VARN"
msgstr ""

