msgid ""
"Splendid job!  With the activation of the Gate, a thousand worlds lie at "
"your feet.  Perhaps on one of them you will find the Ancients themselves, "
"and return with the fruits their great civilization has to offer your world "
"and your kingdom."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/Global.txt.py:679
