msgid "Have mercy, master!  I'm doing my best!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:8
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Unlimited item Identification and a 5 percent bonus on all experience "
"gained.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I studied under Thomas Grey in the School of Sorcery for years to learn to "
"tell one magic item from another.  I'll work for you for 500 gold to start, "
"plus a %17 percent share of all the gold we find. "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Why are you dismissing me?  Don't you find my identification services "
"useful?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:9
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"All map crossings one day faster (minimum one day).  %01 takes %17 percent "
"of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I know shortcuts and back roads throughout the land.  I'll be your guide for"
" a mere 100 gold to start and a %17 percent share of all the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:9
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:10
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "But I cost so little!  Can't you afford %17 percent?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"All map crossings two days faster (minimum one day).  %01 takes %17 percent "
"of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I know shortcuts and back roads throughout the land.  I'll be your guide for"
" 200 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"All map crossings three days faster (minimum one day).  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I know shortcuts and back roads throughout the land.  I'll be your guide for"
" a mere 300 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"All boat travel 2 days faster (minimum one day).  %01 takes %17 percent of "
"all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Uh, Ya.  I can uh, you know, work.  On a boat.  I'll help get you places "
"quicker.  With me, I can get you across the sea two days faster than normal."
"  Uh, I uh, want oh, let's see, 100 gold to start, and %17 percent of the "
"gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:12
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "What, you're just going to dump me?  Here?  "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"All boat travel 3 days faster (minimum one day).  %01 takes %17 percent of "
"all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I've spent quite some time putting together accurate charts of the waters "
"surrounding our continent.  With my charts and my skill, I can get you "
"across water three days faster than normal.  I charge 200 gold to start, "
"plus %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "What did I do to deserve this treatment?  I thought we had a deal?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:14
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Heal Party"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:14
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Cures all party hit points once a day.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold "
"you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:14
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can travel with you, my children, for an initial donation of 500 gold to "
"start and %17 percent of the gold we find to my church.  Once per day I'll "
"be able to heal you of all your wounds, short of death."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:14
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "How can you even think of firing me?  Who will heal your wounds?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:15
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Cures all party hit points and conditions (excepting dead, stoned, or "
"eradicated) once per day.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:15
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"As an expert healer, I can heal your wounds and many other conditions (but "
"not death or turned to stone) once per day.  All I require is a donation of "
"2000 to my church and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:16
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Completely heals party of all hit points and conditions once per day.  %01 "
"takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:16
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"As a master healer, my services are in demand by many, but my power to "
"magically heal only works but once per day.  I can heal everything but "
"eradication, and require a modest initial donation of 5000 gold to my temple"
" and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:17
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Ten percent bonus on all experience learned.  %01 takes %17 percent of all "
"gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:17
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can help you to interpret and understand what you see as you travel. I "
"think my advice will increase your overall experience.  I must charge 300 "
"gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find for my services, however."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:17
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Without me around to tell you how to think, you'll learn a lot slower!  "
"Don't fire me!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Fifteen percent bonus on all experience learned.  %01 takes %17 percent of "
"all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can help you to interpret and understand what you see as you travel. I "
"think my advice will increase your overall experience.  I must charge 700 "
"gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find for my  services, however."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Two point bonus to Armsmaster skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:19
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Everyone benefits from good advice, and my advice on weapons and combat is "
"amongst the best.  During battle, my direction will improve your skill at "
"arms.  I charge but 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:19
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You would give up the benefit of my good advice just like that?  For shame!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Three point bonus to Armsmaster skill for all characters..  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:20
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Everyone benefits from good advice, and my advice on weapons and combat is "
"the best.  During battle, my direction will significantly improve your skill"
" at arms.  I charge but 400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we "
"find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Two point bonus to Elemental (air, earth, fire, water) spell skills for all "
"characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can lend a little magic to boost your Elemental spell skills and ease your"
" magical burden for 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find.."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:21
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:22
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Why throw away the boundless reserves of magic I have to offer when I am so "
"cheap to keep around?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Three point bonus to Elemental (air, earth, fire, water) spell skills for "
"all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can lend a good deal of magic to magnify your Elemental spell skills for "
"1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Four point bonus to Elemental (air, earth, fire, water) spell skills for all"
" characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can lend my considerable magic reserves to sharply increase your Elemental"
" spell skills and effects for the low, low price of 2000 gold to start and "
"%17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:24
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Four point bonus to Merchant skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:24
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, people have trouble bargaining in their own behalf.  I'll be "
"happy to give you advice to better the prices you receive while bargaining "
"with Merchants.  All I ask is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold "
"we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:24
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Fire me?  You must be joking!  You'll lose a lot of money without me around!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:25
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Six point bonus to Merchant skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent"
" of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"As a long time member of the Merchant's Guild, and a former rug merchant "
"myself, I know all the tricks of the trade like the back of my hand.  I can "
"give you advice while bargaining with other Merchants to improve the prices "
"you get.  My fee is but 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we "
"find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:26
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Six point bonus to perception skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:26
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"My eyes are sharp, and my voice is loud.  I can alert you to danger before "
"it strikes.  May save your life…And all I need is 300 gold to start and %17 "
"percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Who will warn you of danger if not me?  You're making a big mistake, boss!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Four point bonus to Alchemy skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent"
" of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"In my studies I've gathered quite a knowledge of reagents and catalysts.  "
"I'm sure I could assist you in creating and mixing potions, if you'll only "
"hire me.  400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:27
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Well!  After all I've done for you you're going to fire me?!  Just like "
"that?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Eight point bonus to Alchemy skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I have dedicated my life to the study and mastery of alchemy.  I can "
"increase the potency of the potions you mix.  I only charge 600 gold to "
"start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Four point bonus to Disarm Traps skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I know a thing or two about fixing tools and whatnot.  I also know about "
"locks.  I can help you pick them if you hire me for 200 gold to start and "
"%17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:29
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You'll be sorry the next time a trap goes off because I wasn't around to "
"save you!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Six point bonus to Disarm Traps skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Locksmithing is a difficult thing to learn, and you need a professional with"
" you to help you handle the toughest locks.  I can work for you for 300 gold"
" to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:31
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Five point bonus to Luck statistic for all characters.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:31
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"The gods favor drunks, children and fools.  Well, I'm a fool!  Take me with "
"you and maybe the gods will favor you too.  All I want is 100 gold to start "
"and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:31
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Sure has been fun following you around!  See ya!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:32
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Twenty point bonus to Luck statistic for all characters.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:32
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"People say Chimney Sweeps are lucky.  I don't know about that– sweeping "
"chimneys is hard work!  But if you want, you could hire me for 200 gold to "
"start and %17 percent of the gold we find..  Maybe I'll bring you good luck."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:33
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"One less day of food use when camping, (minimum of one used).  %01 takes %17"
" percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:33
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"If you need someone to carry some traveller's comforts, like tents and "
"cooking gear, I'm your man!  All I want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent"
" of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:34
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Two less days of food use when camping, (minimum of one used).  %01 takes "
"%17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:34
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"For 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find, I'll organize all"
" your camping needs and carry your gear.  I think you'll find me well worth "
"the price!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:35
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Ten percent bonus on all gold found.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you "
"find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:35
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"For 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find I'll organize your"
" finances and check all the coins you find for rarity.  I can usually "
"increase a client's wealth by 5 percent."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:35
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You're going to lose a lot of money without me, mark my words!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:36
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Twenty percent bonus on all gold found.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold "
"you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:36
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"For 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find I'll organize "
"your finances and check all the coins you find for rarity.  I can usually "
"increase a client's wealth by 10 percent."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Prepare Meal"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:37
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Makes one day of food per day (maximum of 14 days).  %01 takes %17 percent "
"of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:37
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Ever want your own personal cook?  For 300 gold to start and %17 percent of "
"the gold we find, I'll carry extra food and prepare your meals for myself "
"and the four of you.  You won't be sorry– everyone loves my cooking!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:37
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Back to stale bread and water, eh?  <grumble> fine by me."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Prepare Feast"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:38
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Makes two days of food per day (maximum of 14 days).  %01 takes %17 percent "
"of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I have studied in the finest cooking schools in Erathia, and I am willing to"
" prepare your meals for a paltry 400 gold to start and %17 percent of the "
"gold we find.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:39
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Trips using the stables take two days fewer to complete (minimum one day).  "
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:39
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can see you know little about handling horses and getting the most out of "
"them.  I'll be happy to take care of any horses you use when you rent horses"
" at the stables.  You'll get to your destination faster with my help.  All I"
" want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:39
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Well, I guess I can understand.  <sniff> you don't need me anymore."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:40
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Grants a constant, single category bonus to your reputation.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:40
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"My reputation as a famous musician follows me wherever I go.  If I'm with "
"you, I'm sure some of my reputation will rub off on you.  I only need 1000 "
"gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find for living expenses."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I thought we had a deal!  You're just going to cast me aside like trash! How"
" could you?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Increases protection from air, earth, fire, water, body, and mind by 20 "
"constantly.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Dangerous Sorcerers abound throughout the land of Erathia.  Most use spells "
"that do some sort of elemental damage, like fire or lightning.  Others use "
"body or mind magic to assault their foes.  I know a spell that will help "
"protect you from these, and I can keep it going all the time.  I'll cast it "
"for you if you take me along.  All I want is 1000 gold to start and %17 "
"percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Not afraid of hostile magic anymore eh?  Ok, your choice.  Don't say I "
"didn't warn you!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:42
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Keeps the Wizard Eye spell at expert ranking going at all times.  %01 takes "
"%17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:42
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"For 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find, I can cast the "
"Wizard Eye spell at expert level constantly."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:42
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Even if you can cast Wizard eye on your own, keeping me around would save "
"you the spell energy.  Did you think of that?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Wind Walk"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:43
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Casts the Fly spell (duration 2 hours) once per day.  %01 takes %17 percent "
"of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:43
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Ever want to fly?  Take me with you and I can cast the Fly spell on you once"
" a day.  All I ask is 2000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we "
"find.  Cheap, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You're would give up the power of flight over a few measly gold pieces?  "
"Think it through carefully, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Cross Water"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:44
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Casts the Water Walk spell (duration 3 hours) once per day.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:44
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Ancient prophets claimed the power to walk on water, and I've rediscovered "
"their secret.  Once per day I can cast the Water Walk spell on you and "
"everyone with you.  My rate is 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the "
"gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You're would give up the power to walk on water over a few measly gold "
"pieces?  Think it through carefully, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:45
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Gate to Town"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:45
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Casts the Town Portal spell at master ranking once per day.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:45
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"There are spells that duplicate some of the natural magical features of "
"Erathia.  One of those, Town Portal, I've learned to cast at master level.  "
"I'll  cast it for you up to once per day if you hire me.  My price is 2000 "
"gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:45
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You're would give up the power to travel instantly for a few measly gold "
"pieces?  Think it through carefully, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:46
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Bless Party"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:46
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Casts the Bless spell (duration 2 hours) at master ranking once per day.  "
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:46
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"For a donation of 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find to "
"my temple, I'll travel with you and cast the Bless spell once per day."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:46
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I checked with the gods, and they said they would be angry with you if you "
"dismissed me.  Just thought I would let you know…"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Play Tune"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:47
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Casts the Heroism spell (duration 2 hours) at master ranking once per day.  "
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:47
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"All armies travelling in style bring a piper along to inspire them to heroic"
" deeds during combat.  Even small groups like your own can benefit.  I'll "
"travel with you for 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You'll miss my inspiring battle tunes!  It makes a big difference during "
"battle!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:48
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"All travel times reduced by one day (minimum of one day).  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:48
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"My experience in travelling the world can speed your journeys by a day "
"whether you travel by land or by sea.  All I require is 100 gold to start "
"and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You don't find me useful?  Well, just remember that I save you time, and "
"time is money!    "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:49
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"All boat travel reduced by two days, gold is increased by ten percent when "
"found, and Reputation is decreased by one full category.  %01 takes %17 "
"percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:49
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Arrr.  My life as a freedom-loving sailor has taught me to travel quickly on"
" the seas and count my gold well.  But I'm down on my luck these days, so "
"I'll sign on with you for only 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold"
" we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:49
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Arrr.  Ye be firing this poor old sailor unjustly ye be.  Won't ye "
"reconsider?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:50
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Armor and weapon skills are increased by two points for each character.  %01"
" takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:50
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"All warriors need a squire to take care of their weapons and armor and back "
"them up in battle.  I'll be your squire for 600 gold to start and %17 "
"percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:51
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Perception skill is increased by five points and Luck statistics are "
"increased by ten points for each character.  %01 takes %17 percent of all "
"gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:51
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Fortune is my business, and I can improve your fortunes for 400 gold to "
"start and %17 percent of the gold we find.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I predict you'll regret dismissing me!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:52
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Food use is reduced by one day's worth of food when resting (minimum one "
"day), Merchant skill is increased by three points for each character, and "
"Reputation is decreased by one full category.  %01 takes %17 percent of all "
"gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:52
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"My entire life has been spent on the road, and believe me when I say you "
"gotta know how to travel and you gotta know how to deal.  I can help you "
"with both for 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I cook your food and save you money, and this is the thanks I get?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Your party is considered to have the most beneficial arrangement of races in"
" any social situation while %01 is in your party.  %01 takes %17 percent of "
"all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:53
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Not everyone knows how to talk strangers into giving them what they want.  I"
" make it my specialty.  Bring me along and I'll use my skills to ease your "
"way through society.  My rate is 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the "
"gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Wait!  Let's talk about this!  I know you don't really want to dismiss me.  "
"We can work it out!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:54
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Merchant skill is increased by eight points for each character and "
"Reputation is decreased by one full category.  %01 takes %17 percent of all "
"gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:54
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Lots of people can be talked out of stuff they would never give up if they "
"thought about it.  The trick is to talk fast and don't let them pause to "
"consider what you're really saying.  I'll stay with you and coach you on "
"this valuable skill for only 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold "
"we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Disarm Traps and Stealing skills are increased by eight points for each "
"character and Reputation is decreased by one full category.  %01 costs you "
"nothing!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Need traps disarmed?  Perhaps something retrieved without the owner's "
"knowledge or consent?  I've been doing it ever since I was released from "
"jail three years ago.  If you need help, I'll come with you for free!  I "
"need the practice.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "What?  I didn't do nothin!  "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Hour of Power"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Casts Hour of Power once per day for a duration of six hours.  %01 takes %17"
" percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Few people outside of the Wizard's realm possess the knowledge to cast Hour "
"of Power.  I can cast it once per day for your party if you'll hire me.  I "
"only charge 2500 gold initially, and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You're would give up all the spells I cast on you for a few measly gold "
"pieces?  Think it through carefully, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Two point bonus to Self (body, mind, spirit) spell skills for all "
"characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can assist your spell casting by slightly boosting your spells of the Self"
" for 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find.."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:57
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:58
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"By firing me, you're not just losing a friend and spiritual advisor, but "
"your link to the Gods!  I know you don't really mean it.  You won't dismiss "
"me."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Initiate"
msgstr "Iniciado"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Three point bonus to Self (body, mind, spirit) spell skills for all "
"characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"My prayers can magnify your Self spell skills for 1000 gold to start and %17"
" percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Four point bonus to Self (body, mind, spirit) spell skills for all "
"characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can greatly increase the effect of your Self spells for a small initial "
"donation of of 2000 gold and then %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Monk"
msgstr "Monje"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Increases the unarmed and dodging skills by two for all characters.  %01 "
"takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I can help train your minds and bodies to perfect your unarmored, unarmed "
"combat techniques.  I only require 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the "
"gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You, uh, haven't snatched the pebble from my hand yet, grasshopper.  Will "
"you cut short your training so casually?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Increases the identify item and identify monster skills by six for all "
"characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I have considerable knowledge of the items and creatures of Erathia.  I'd be"
" willing to help you out in your travels for 750 gold to start and %17 "
"percent of the gold we find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"You will miss my excellent advice and knowledge the minute I am gone, mark "
"my words!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Hunter"
msgstr "Cazador"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Increases the identify monster skill by four for all characters.  %01 takes "
"%17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"I've hunted most every type of creature in Erathia, and I know a little "
"something about all of them.  Though I'm retired from hunting, I'll share my"
" knowledge with you for 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we "
"find."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid ""
"Well, this old hunter knows not to beg.  Go on and dismiss me if you want."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:2
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Emerald Island is southeast of Erathia, and far away from pirates and other ruffians.  It would be ideal, if not for the constant swarms of dragonflies that infest the island.  Fortunately, the large number of armed and skilled people this contest has attracted should thin their numbers a bit.\n"
"\n"
"Lord Markham has supplemented the normally sparse village with a weapon, armor, and alchemist shop for your convenience during the contest.  A temple and basic magical guilds are also available.  I would suggest making sure that you are completely ready before you start off on the contest."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"You have decided that you no longer desire my information about the places "
"on Emerald Island.  If you later decide that you'd like to hear what I have "
"to say, then select Tour On."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:190
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Priests.  You have come to me seeking that I be your guide on the Path of Light.  But be warned, to learn its ways, you must learn the ways of your own soul.  I would suggest that we meditate on this for awhile, but you look like you're in a hurry.  South of Bracada is an island called Evenmorn, and upon that island are the old temples of the Sun and the Moon.  Both are inhabited by the remnants of the two religions, their once proud churches reduced to two old temples fighting for a small island.\n"
"\n"
"The Church of the Sun was the founding religion for our current faith, the Path of Light.  I propose we help them out and tip the balance in favor of the Church of the Sun.  Using the map that Daedalus Falk sent you to find in order to become priests, convince a sea captain to bring you to the island.  There, bring aid and comfort to the Church of the Sun by purifying the altar in the Church of the Moon.  This will so weaken the Moon cult that the Church of the Sun will be able to overcome them in battle.  Return to me when you have done this.   "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:199
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Priests.  [Falk gazes coldly at you] Well it is that you have come to see the wisdom of the Path of the Dark.  Never regret your decision, and never look back.  South of Bracada is an island called Evenmorn, and upon that island are the old temples of the Sun and the Moon.  Both are inhabited by the remnants of the two religions, their once proud churches reduced to two old temples fighting for a small island.\n"
"\n"
"The Church of the Moon was the founding religion for our current faith, the Path of Darkness.  I propose we help them out and tip the balance in favor of the Church of the Moon.  Using the map that I sent you to find, convince a sea captain to bring you to the island.  There, bring aid and comfort to the Church of the Moon by defiling the altar in the Church of the Sun.  This will so weaken the Sun cult that the Church of the Moon will be able to overcome them in battle.  Return to me when you have done this.   "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:207
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Welcome back, students.  The golem lesson was just an exercise, but to advance to Archmage, you really have to do something for the profession.  Copies of the fabled Divine Intervention spell are very rare, and unfortunately the School doesn't have one.  There's been a history of bad luck regarding the spell.\n"
"\n"
"It has been around for time immemorial, but the spell has never found its way into our hands.  Always just out of reach, we often send guild members to find it, but every one has failed.  Sometimes they have it in their hands, but lose it on the way back, other times, the book seems to vanish, only to resurface 20 years later in some old dungeon, or on a deserted island.  Right now, we think it's in the Breeding Zone in the Pit.  Find the spell, and return with it.  Break the curse!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:212
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Fear not death?  I can perform the Ritual on any Wizard.  You need a Soul Jar.  Years ago the Wizards stole a shipment of Jars en route from Nighon to Deyja.  The jars are very hard to destroy, so they hid them, thinking we would never be able to find them.\n"
"\n"
"Fortunately for us, dead men do indeed tell tales.  Better, in fact, than living ones--dead men never forget, never refuse to talk, and never lie.  So, we found the one who buried the Jars, and made him die.  He was very cooperative after his death, and said he hid them somewhere in the Walls of Mist for the Wizards in Celeste. \n"
"\n"
"Retrieve these jars and I will perform the Ritual on all Wizards amongst you.  The rest may become Honorary Liches, for what that's worth, in thanks for finding the extra Jars for us."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:248
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Welcome back, Lords of Harmondale!  Now, I will help you.  My engineer will work for you.  Fix up your castle.  You have my thanks.  You are welcome here forever.\n"
"\n"
"Hmmph.  One more thing.  Your work has interested the other courts.  They will send ambassadors to you now--check your throne room.  Watch your back, my friends."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:264
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"[Queen Catherine inclines her head regally] You are the lot that won Lord Markham's silly contest, I see.  I must admit I had little faith until the Dwarf King recognized you as the rightful rulers of Harmondale.  You must have done something to win his respect, or he would have nothing to do with you.  I'm still not sure what he saw in you, but perhaps there really is something of substance here.  We shall see.\n"
"\n"
"Maybe you can do something for me that would make me think I should let you keep your new titles.  Recently, a valuable...agent of mine was arrested in the Tularean Forest for merely doing his job.  They're keeping him in a cave somewhere outside of Pierpont.  His name is Loren Steel, and they are threatening to execute him if certain unacceptable conditions are not met in 28 days.  Return with him before then and you will win respect, gold, and gratitude."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:315
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Our plans rapidly approach their conclusion, but there is a hitch.  The Kreegan--also known as the Devils, or the Demons, must be destroyed before we finish our plans.  They represent a terrible threat, and though they do little but lick their wounds today, will one day regain their strength and devastate the world.  If anything we do is to have lasting effect, we must first destroy these monsters for once and for all.\n"
"\n"
"You are strong, but not strong enough to defeat the devils on your own.  They are vulnerable to the brand of magic most commonly wielded by the Necromancers, and less so by our own Wizards.  It is imperative that you infiltrate the Devil's base and kill their leader Xenofex.  That should end their threat to this world for some time.  The Warlocks have dug a tunnel from their volcano to the Land of the Giants-- the land the Devils claim as their own.  Perhaps you can use that."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:332
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Soon our plans will bear fruit, but there are a few details that must be handled before we are ready.  The Kreegan, also known as the Devils, share this world with us.  The only reason we're sharing is because they are weak right now.  If they ever get strong, they will try to kill every person in the world.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, it's no fun to rule a world full of dead people, so we have to kill the Devils before they kill us.  Our plan is for you to infiltrate the Devils lair and destroy their leader, Xenofex.  The warlocks of Nighon have dug a tunnel from their volcano to the Land of the Giants-- the land of the Devils.  You can probably use that tunnel to get there."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:350
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Our finest hour is upon us.  While you have been taking care of all those important tasks, my compatriots and I have been struggling with our former friends for the parts we need to rebuild the Heavenly Forge of legend.  By former friends, I mean the four chief advisors to King Magnus of the Wizards.  They have a plan to build a gate to the Ancients.  They could have stood with us, but threw it all away on some vague hope of a 'better future'.  But you!  You have stood with us all this time.\n"
"\n"
"Only one task remains--we need the Oscillation Overthruster from our old vehicle, the Lincoln.  We have been unable to find one on your world.  The ship is in the sea west of Avlee and secured against entry, even from ourselves.  Now you must wear our environment suits, enter the ship, and return with the Overthruster.  Our old environments suits have been prepared for you in the chest outside this throne room.  For the suit to function properly you must not be wearing any equipment.We will stand watch over the Forge, and defend it against our enemies.  Bring us the Overthruster, my friends, and together, we shall rule the world!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:356
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"You need to have your own deck of cards to play. We will supply the opponent.  Victory conditions vary per inn. Build your tower, destroy your opponent's tower, or collect enough resources before your opponent does. \n"
"\n"
"Large yellow numbers in column are the generators. This is how many new units of a particular resource you will receive on your next turn. Small black numbers in column are the resources. This is how many units you have available to spend on your current turn.\n"
"\n"
"Cards: Each have their own cost to play, indicated in a small circle in the lower right corner of the card. The cost will be deducted from your resources according to the color of the card.  Left click on a card plays the card. Right click on a card to discard without playing.\n"
"\n"
"Red represents your Quarry Generator which produces your Brick resources, blue represents your Magic Generator which produces Gem resources, green represents your Zoo generator which produces Beast resources. \n"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:427
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"With Expert Light Magic you can learn all of the Expert spells for this "
"element.  Higher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater "
"assistance to your party.  Expert Light Magic can be yours if you have a "
"skill level of 4 in Light Magic and can pay the price of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:430
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"With Expert Dark Magic you can learn all of the Expert spells for this "
"element.  Higher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater "
"assistance to your party.  Expert Dark Magic can be yours if you have a "
"skill level of 4 in Dark Magic and can pay the price of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:451
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"My brother, Elron, was an avid Arcomage player.  Have you played Arcomage yet?  Horribly addicting game, if I do say so.  In any rate, you can only play if you have a deck, and decks are hard to come by… so I guess you probably haven't.  In any case, Elron wanted to go over some strategies to help him win more games.  Unfortunately, he didn't want to be in town because he didn't want anyone else to spy on him learn his tricks so he went to the White Cliff Caves southeast a bit from town.\n"
"\n"
"Elron hasn't been back in almost a week.  I'm certain something horrible has happened to him, but if he's alive I'd like to know that too.  Would you do me the service of locating him?  I don't have a lot of money to pay you back with, but I'd be greatly in your debt."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:735
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"::You receive a telepathic message:: My…Lords.  My name is Archibald Ironfist.  You've probably heard of me--it is I who, up until recently, was the ruler of the Pit.  With my retirement, I find myself no longer concerned with the affairs of state.  I know that we were adversaries, but I am forced to ask for your help.  In return, I think I can help you.\n"
"\n"
"With the aid of equipment I have found in my new laboratory, I have discovered that my brother Roland, husband to Queen Catherine of Erathia, remains imprisoned by the devils in their foul, ah, dwelling.  I overheard that you're on your way to do battle with them (this equipment really is wonderful), and I want to make sure it goes well.  My brother has stolen the key to their leader's chambers, and has hidden it in the beastly cage they're keeping him in.  \n"
"\n"
"Please rescue him!  Not even I can bear to think of my brother in those conditions!  To help you along, I offer this weapon.  It was...found by my loyal servant sergeant Piridak, amongst my advisor's personal belongings.  I hope it helps."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTOPIC.TXT.py:203
msgctxt "npctopic"
msgid "Staff GrandMaster"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/PlaceMon.txt.py:6
msgctxt "placemon"
msgid "Super Vampire (fix)"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:2
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:2
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"A staff is a two-handed pole equally good on offense and defense.  Expert "
"ranking in the staff will increase your armor class and master ranking will "
"allow you to occasionally stun your opponents."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:2
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Staff usable with the Unarmed skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:3
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"The sword skill covers most types of blades longer than a knife.  Expert "
"swordsmen gain a quicker attack while master swordsmen may use any one-"
"handed sword in their left hand and another weapon in their right."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:5
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"While rather slow on the attack, axes do a lot of damage when they hit.  "
"Expert axe fighters gain a little more speed on their attacks while master "
"axe fighters can deliver extra damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Spear covers all kinds of pole weapons with blades attached to the business "
"end.  Spears are versatile and can be used one or two handed (they work "
"better with two hands)."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:8
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Mace skill covers all kinds of blunt trauma weapons ranging from batons to "
"flails.  Expert mace swingers do extra damage with their weapons while "
"master ranking gives a chance to stun opponents."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:9
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"A weapon from before the Silence, their making has long since been lost.  "
"Expert and Master Blasters gain double and triple accuracy with these "
"awesome weapons."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Shield skill directly improves a character’s armor class while a shield is "
"employed.  Expert and master ranking in the shield increase this defensive "
"bonus."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Leather armor is the lightest armor a character can wear.  While leather "
"provides less protection than chain or plate armor, it also slows your "
"character down the least.  Leather armor skill increases the protection "
"offered by leather armor.  As with all armors, Expert and master ranking "
"both reduce the amount the armor slows you down."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:12
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Chain armor is the medium armor type.  It provides more protection than "
"leather and less than plate, but it also slows your character down more than"
" leather.  Chain armor skill increases the protection offered by chain "
"armor.  As with all armors, Expert and master ranking both reduce the amount"
" the armor slows you down."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Plate armor is the heaviest armor type.  It provides the most protection, "
"but it slows your character down more than leather or chain.  Plate armor "
"skill increases the protection offered by plate armor.  As with all armors, "
"Expert and master ranking both reduce the amount the armor slows you down."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:14
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:14
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Fire magic is a good source of offensive spells and includes spells having "
"to do with speed.  Expert and master ranking permit access to greater "
"versions of fire spells."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:15
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:15
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Air magic tends to be defensive and informational in nature and includes "
"spells having to do with flight.  Expert and master ranking permit access to"
" greater versions of air spells."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:16
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Water magic is equally defensive and offensive and concentrates on spells "
"that move or change things.  Expert and master ranking permit access to "
"greater versions of water spells."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:17
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Earth magic is defensive and includes spells that protect, bind, and "
"strengthen.  Expert and master ranking permit access to greater versions of "
"earth spells."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Spirit magic concentrates on spells involving life and death.  Included are "
"spells to raise the dead, spells that affect the Undead, and spells that "
"influence aging.  Expert and master ranking permit access to greater "
"versions of spirit spells."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:19
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Mind magic tends to be offensive and informational in nature.  Charm, fear, "
"and telekinesis are all examples of mind magic.  Expert and master ranking "
"permit access to greater versions of mind magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:20
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Body magic is concerned with spells of healing and enhancement.  Spells to "
"heal, wound, and cure disease and poison are all part of body magic.  Expert"
" and master ranking permit access to greater versions of body magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Light magic spells represent some of the strongest spells in Erathia.  "
"Usable only by Clerics and Sorcerers, light magic cannot be chosen before "
"creating your characters; rather, light magic must be learned and mastered "
"during your travels."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Dark magic spells are the strongest spells in Erathia.  While casting spells"
" of darkness can have spectacular results, dark spells sometimes come with "
"unwanted side effects…  Dark magic cannot be chosen before creating your "
"characters, and is restricted to Clerics and Sorcerers."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:23
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"The identify skill will automatically identify an item if your character’s "
"skill level is high enough when you right click on an item.  Certain items "
"require your character to be an expert or master in this skill to properly "
"identify them."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:25
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Repair skill allows your characters to repair broken equipment.  Higher "
"skill level allows you to repair better items and expert and master skill "
"rankings allow you to repair complex items and artifacts.  The skill will "
"work automatically when you right click on a broken item in your inventory."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:26
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Bodybuilding skill adds hit points directly to your character’s hit point "
"totals.  Multiply the skill in bodybuilding by the character’s base class "
"bonus (4 for knights, 1 for sorcerers, etc.) to get the total.  Expert "
"ranking doubles this total and master triples it."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Meditation skill adds spell points directly to your character’s spell point "
"totals.  Multiply the skill in meditation by the character’s base class "
"bonus (4 for sorcerers, 0 for knights, etc.) to get the total.  Expert "
"ranking doubles this total and master triples it."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:28
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Perception increases your chance of noticing a trap as it goes off and "
"reducing or avoiding the damage it would cause  Perception also allows your "
"character to notice treasures where others would not.  Higher perception "
"skill allows you to escape stronger traps and notice harder to find "
"treasures."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Diplomacy helps to soften the impact of begging, bribing, or threatening "
"someone to get them to cooperate with you.  The higher the skill, the less "
"your reputation will suffer when you take any of those actions.  Expert and "
"master ranking will double and triple the effects of diplomacy."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Skill reduces reputation cost of begging, bribing, or threatening."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:29
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Grandmaster text here"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Not Used"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Normal Text goes here"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Expert Text goes here"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Master Text goes here"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:31
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:31
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Disarm traps skill is checked automatically when opening a trapped chest or "
"other container.  A higher skill in disarm traps gives a better chance of "
"disarming the trap.  Expert and Master rank doubles and triples the chance "
"to successfully disarm the trap."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Identify Monster allows you to gain more information from creatures when you"
" right click on them.  Initially you will learn their exact number of hit "
"points if your skill is sufficient.  You can gain additional information at "
"Expert and Master ranks."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Armsmaster skill represents the warrior's tricks of the trade.  Initially, "
"armsmaster reduces the recovery times of your melee weapons, and later on "
"can give you a bonus to hit and even damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Alchemy skill allows you to mix potions.  Without the alchemy skill, you "
"barely have the knowledge to make a simple potion, though alchemy skill is "
"added to the strength value of the base ingredient to determine the strength"
" of a simple potion.  As you attain Expert, Master, and Grandmaster ranking "
"in alchemy, you learn to mix more complicated potions."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:38
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid ""
"Learning skill directly increases the experience your character receives.  "
"Every point of skill is a percent of awarded experience that is given as a "
"bonus (plus a starting bonus of 9%).  Five skill points would turn a 100 "
"experience point award into a 114 experience point award.  Expert doubles "
"and master triples this bonus, so 10 points of learning at master rank would"
" give a 39% bonus to all experience point gain."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPCITEMS.TXT.py:43
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SPCITEMS.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "spcitems"
msgid "Double damage vs Demons."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPCITEMS.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "spcitems"
msgid "Demon Slaying"
msgstr "Exterminio de demonios"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPCITEMS.TXT.py:67
msgctxt "spcitems"
msgid "Double Damage vs. Elves."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPCITEMS.TXT.py:67
msgctxt "spcitems"
msgid "Elf Slaying"
msgstr "Exterminio de Elfos"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:3
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:4
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Torch light increases the radius of light surrounding your party in the "
"dark.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Brightest Light"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Launches a burst of fire at a single target.  Damage is 1-3 points of damage"
" per point of skill in Fire Magic, but casting cost is low.  Firebolt is "
"safe and effective—the “Old Reliable” of the Sorcerer’s arsenal."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to fire magic by an amount equal "
"to your skill in Fire and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Causes a weapon that has no special abilities to burn with a magical fire, "
"giving the weapon the 'of fire' ability.  This spell lasts for one hour per "
"point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Of Fire"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Of Flame"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Of Infernoes"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Reduces the time it takes to recover from casting a spell or attacking with "
"a weapon.  Characters will become weak after this spell wears off.  This "
"spell affects the entire party at once."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:8
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:9
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Another Sorcerer’s favorite, fireball targets a single monster, but explodes"
" to hurt anyone else caught in the blast.  If your party is too close to the"
" blast, they will be hurt as well.  Fireball does 1-6 points of damage per "
"point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Summons flaming rocks from the sky in a large radius surrounding your chosen"
" target.  Try not to be near the victim when you use this spell.  A single "
"meteor does 8 points of damage plus 1 per point of skill in Fire Magic.  "
"This spell only works outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:13
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Inferno burns all monsters in sight when cast, excluding your characters.  "
"Good for cleaning out rooms full of weak or moderate strength monsters in "
"one or two easy castings.  Each monster takes 12 points of damage plus 1 per"
" point of skill in Fire Magic.  This spell only works indoors."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:14
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Amongst the strongest direct damage spells available, Incinerate inflicts "
"massive damage on a single target.  Only the strongest of monsters can "
"expect to survive this spell.  Damage is 15 points plus 1-15 per point of "
"skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:15
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:16
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Wizard Eye causes the automap located in the upper right corner of the main "
"gaming screen to show the locations of monsters and other points of interest"
" while outdoors.  The spell lasts 1 hour per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:15
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shows 'points of interest'"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:16
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:20
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Feather Fall prevents your characters from being hurt when falling more than"
" ten feet by slowing the speed of the fall.  Feather Fall affects your "
"entire party with one casting and has a duration based on your skill in Air "
"Magic. "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to air magic by an amount equal to"
" your skill in Air and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:19
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:23
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Jump launches your party up in the air, landing you 60 feet from where you "
"started.  Your party takes no falling damage from the jump."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:21
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:22
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Sorcerer’s Darling, Lightning Bolt discharges electricity from the caster’s "
"hand to a single target.  It always hits and does 1-8 points of damage per "
"point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"This spell can't be cast while hostile monsters are nearby.  Invisibility "
"works on the minds of nearby creatures, making them unable to notice the "
"party unless spoken to or attacked.  Any sort of attack, regardless of "
"whether or not it hits or misses, will break this spell."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:24
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:25
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Grants the power of flight to your characters!  This spell is very expensive"
" and only works outdoors, but it is very useful.  Fly will drain one spell "
"point every five minutes it is in use (I.E. when you aren't touching the "
"ground)."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Calls stars from the heavens to smite and burn your enemies.  Twenty stars "
"are called, and the damage for each star is 20 points plus 1 per point of "
"skill in Air Magic, and Starburst only works outdoors.  Try not to get "
"caught in the blast…"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Sprays poison at monsters directly in front of your characters.  Damage is "
"low, but few monsters have resistance to water magic, so it usually works.  "
"Each shot does 2 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill in Water "
"Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to Water magic by an amount equal "
"to your skill in Water and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a single bolt of ice at a single target.  It always hits and does 1-4 "
"points of damage per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:31
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Only useful outdoors, Water Walk lets your characters walk along the surface"
" of water without sinking.  This spell can be very useful, but constantly "
"drains one spell point every 20 minutes while in contact with water."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Item loses 50% - 1 per point of skill in water magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Item loses 30% - 1 per point of skill in water magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Item loses 20% - 1 per point of skill in water magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Gives a chance to imbue a normal item with magical powers.  The chance of "
"success is 10% per point of skill in Water Magic.  Grandmasters can manage "
"better enchantments."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Town Portal teleports the party to the central fountain of any town the "
"player has visited.  Town Portal has a 10% chance per point of Water Magic "
"skill of working when cast, and cannot be used while hostile monsters are "
"nearby.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a ball of ice in the direction the caster is facing.  The ball will "
"shatter when it hits something, launching 7 shards of ice in all directions "
"except the caster’s.  The shards will ricochet until they strike a creature "
"or melt.  Each shard does 12 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in"
" Water Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Lloyd’s Beacon lets you place a marker at a location you want to teleport "
"back to in the future.  Just how far in the future depends on your skill in "
"Water Magic.  Cast this spell whenever you wish to either place a marker or "
"return to one.  These beacons will decay after 1week per point of skill in "
"Water magic after they are cast."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to Earth magic by an amount equal "
"to your skill in Earth and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:42
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Summons a swarm of biting, stinging insects to bedevil a single target.  The"
" swarm only does 5 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Earth "
"Magic, but it never misses."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases the armor class of all characters by 5 + 1 point per point of "
"skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:45
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:46
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Removes the stoned condition from a character if you cast this spell in "
"time.  The greater the skill and rank in Earth Magic the longer the "
"condition could have been present before the “point of no return” is "
"reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine "
"Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:46
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:47
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Releases a magical stone into the world that will explode when it comes into"
" contact with a creature or enough time passes.  The rock will bounce and "
"roll until it finds a resting spot, so be careful not to be caught in the "
"blast.  The explosion causes 1-8 points of damage per point of skill in "
"Earth Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a magical stone far into the air that creates a very large and "
"powerful explosion, sending shards of explosive earth raining to the ground."
"  The damage is 20 points plus 1 per point of skill in Earth Magic for each "
"shard.  This spell can only be used outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Allows the party to see an opponent's current health as an exact number."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Removes the cursed condition from a character if you cast this spell in "
"time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the "
"condition could have been present before the “point of no return” is "
"reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine "
"Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Preservation more tightly binds the soul to the body, delaying death due to "
"massive hit point loss, but will not stop a character from going "
"unconscious.  If hit points are still too low when the spells wears off, "
"such a wounded character will then die."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"This spell attempts to weaken the link between the body and soul, causing 10"
" + 2-8 points of damage per point of skill in Spirit Magic.  Because of the "
"nature of the spell, the caster must be very close to the victim to set of "
"the magic.  If the target is out of range when the spell is cast, the spell "
"will fail without draining spell points."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:59
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Raises a character from the dead if you cast this spell in time.  The "
"greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the character could "
"have been dead before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the "
"only way to raise the character short of Divine Intervention is to visit a "
"temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Resurrects an eradicated (body destroyed) character.  Recovery rate is very "
"slow, but will be faster for characters with a higher skill in Spirit Magic."
"  The resurrected character will be in the weak condition after this spell "
"is cast."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:63
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Removes the afraid condition from a character if you cast this spell in "
"time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the condition"
" could have been present before the “point of no return” is reached.  After "
"that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is "
"to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a bolt of mental force damaging to a single targets’ nervous system.  "
"Mind Blast does 3 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Mind "
"Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to mind magic by an amount equal "
"to your skill in Mind and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures paralysis if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and "
"rank in Mind Magic the longer the character could have been paralyzed before"
" the \"point of no return\" is reached.  After that, the only way to remove "
"the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:70
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:70
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"All creatures in the caster’s sight fear the caster and flee.  If a creature"
" takes damage while under the influence of this spell, the spell will be "
"broken.  Mass Fear will not work on Undead creatures.  The duration of Mass "
"Fear is 3 minutes per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:71
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:72
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures insanity if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and "
"rank in Mind Magic the longer the character could have been insane before "
"the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the"
" condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:72
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Similar to Mind Blast, Psychic Shock targets a single creature with mind "
"damaging magic, only to a much greater effect.  Psychic Shock does 12 points"
" of damage plus 1-12 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Takes control of target's mind for 10 minutes per point of skill in Mind "
"Magic.  Enslaved creatures will fight monsters that are hostile to the "
"caster for the duration of the spell, and will not fight with the caster "
"even if attacked by the caster or his friends.  This spell will not work on "
"the Undead."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:75
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures the weak condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  "
"The greater the skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character could "
"have been weak before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the "
"only way to cure the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a "
"temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:80
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures hit points on a single target when cast.  The number cured is equal to"
" five plus 2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points plus 3 per point of skill.  Ranged casting ok."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to body magic by an amount equal "
"to your skill in Body and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slowly heals hit points over time, Duration 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster hit point recovery / minute"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest hit point recovery / minute"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:80
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures poison in a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the"
" skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character could have been "
"poisoned before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only "
"way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a "
"temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Hammerhands magically enhances the skill of an unarmed combatant, allowing "
"his strikes to land more precisely against an opponent's weak spots.  "
"Hammerhands inflicts Body Magic damage equal to the physical damage caused "
"by the unarmed attack."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:82
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures disease in a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater "
"the skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character could have been "
"diseased before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only "
"way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a "
"temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:84
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:85
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Flying Fist throws a heavy magical force at a single opponent that does 30 "
"points of damage plus 1-5 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:88
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:92
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Calls upon the power of Heaven to undo the evil magic that extends the lives"
" of the Undead, inflicting 16 points of damage plus 1-16 per point of skill "
"in Light Magic upon a single, unlucky target.  This spell only works on the "
"Undead."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:89
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:90
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Removes all spells on all creatures in the caster’s sight, both helpful and "
"harmful.  Recovery is reduced by an amount equal to skill in Light Magic  ."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:90
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:96
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Paralyze temporarily prevents a monster from moving or attacking for the "
"(short) duration of this spell, which is 3 minutes per point of skill in "
"Light Magic.  You are free to attack your helpless target 'til your heart's "
"content--paralyzed monsters cannot retaliate."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Summons a Lesser Light Elemental to fight for the party.  It will stay until"
" the spell duration runs out or it is destroyed.  You can have no more than "
"1 elemental summoned at once."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 5 minutes per point of skill.  1 elemental at one time"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Summons a normal elemental.  Duration 15 minutes per point of skill. 3 "
"elementals at once"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a greater elemental.  5 Elementals maximum."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:92
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Temporarily increases all seven stats on all your characters by three times "
"your skill in Light magic.  This spell lasts until you rest."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:96
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Sun Ray is the second most devastating spell in the game, concentrating the "
"light of the sun on one unfortunate creature.  Since Sun Ray must focus the "
"light of the sun, it can only work outdoors and during the day.  Sun Ray "
"does 20 points of damage plus 1-20 per point of skill in Light Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:97
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Three times per day you may call upon the heavens to heal your characters of"
" all damage, restore your spell points, and remove all adverse conditions.  "
"The gods exact a price, however, aging the caster 10 years for each Divine "
"Intervention.  Recovery from this spell is shortend with skill in Light "
"Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:99
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creature gets 20 hit points per skill point (up to creature's maximum)"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:101
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Enchants a weapon with the Vampiric ability.  Damage inflicted on monsters "
"struck by this weapon will be given to the weapon's wielder as extra hit "
"points, up to his normal hit point maximum."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Shrinks even the grandest of monsters to more manageable sizes. Duration of "
"this spell is 5 minutes per point of skill in Dark Magic.  A shrunken "
"monster deals one half, one third, or one quarter its normal damage while "
"shrunk."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Area Effect (Shrinks a group of monsters)"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:103
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a blast of hot, jagged metal in front of the caster, striking any "
"creature that gets in the way.  Each piece inflicts 6 points of damage plus "
"1-6 per point of skill in Dark Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Takes control of an Undead target's mind for 10 minutes per point of skill "
"in Mind Magic.  Controlled Undead will fight monsters that are hostile to "
"the caster for the duration of the spell, and will not fight with the caster"
" even if attacked by the caster or his friends."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"When a monster hits a character with Pain Reflection active, the monster "
"takes damage equal to what it inflicted in the character."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"This evil spell immediately slays a single hireling, reducing the reputation"
" of the party significantly.  The caster's spell points are completely "
"returned, and all conditions, hit points, and magical aging are immediately "
"healed."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:107
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Dragon Breath empowers the caster to exhale a cloud of toxic vapors that "
"target a single monster and damage all creatures nearby.  This spell is the "
"most powerful damage spell in the land, doing 1-25 points of damage per "
"point of skill in Dark Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:108
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"This spell is the town killer.  It can only be cast three times per day and "
"only outdoors.  Armageddon inflicts 50 points of damage plus 1 point of "
"damage for every point of Dark skill your character has to every creature on"
" the map, including all your characters.   "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:2
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:2
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Might is the statistic that represents a character's overall strength, and "
"the ability to put that strength where it counts.  Characters with a high "
"might statistic do more damage in combat."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Intellect represents a character's ability to reason and understand complex,"
" abstract concepts.  A high intellect contributes to Sorcerer, Archer, "
"Ranger, Thief, and Druid spell points"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Personality represents both a character's strength of will and personal "
"charm.  Clerics, Paladins, Rangers, Monks, and Druids depend on personality "
"for their spell points."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:5
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:5
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Endurance is a measure of the physical toughness and durability of a "
"character.  A high endurance gives a character more hit points."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:6
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:6
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Accuracy represents a character's precision and hand-eye coordination.  A "
"high accuracy will allow a character to hit monsters more frequently in "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:7
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:7
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Speed is a measure of how quick a character is.  A high speed statistic will"
" increase a character's armor class and the rate with which the character "
"recovers from attacks."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:9
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:9
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Hit points indicate how much damage your character can sustain before "
"falling unconscious or dying.  A character is unconscious at zero hit points"
" or less.  Hit points return after 8 hours of uninterrupted rest."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:10
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Armor Class is a measure of how difficult it is for a monster to hit a "
"character.  The higher the armor class, the better the chance of avoiding an"
" attack."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:11
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Spell points are needed to cast spells.  Every spell has a spell point cost "
"that is deducted from this statistic when it's cast.  Spell points return "
"after 8 hours of uninterrupted rest."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:12
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Condition shows the worst 'effect' your character is suffering, such as "
"poisoned, diseased, or dead.  Many conditions seriously hurt your "
"character's ability to fight, and should be cured as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:13
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"The Quick Spell is the spell that will be cast when you use the 's' key to "
"cast a spell, or control-click on a monster.  You can set the quick spell by"
" opening your spell book ('c'), clicking on the spell you want to set, then "
"clicking on the set spell tab at the bottom of the spell book."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:17
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:17
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Attack Bonus is the sum of all factors (skill, spells, Accuracy, etc.) that "
"influence your character's chance to hit monsters with an equipped weapon.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Fire Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from "
"fire attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce fire damage, it "
"does not make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Air Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from "
"air attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce air damage, it "
"does not make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Water Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from"
" water attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce water damage, "
"it does not make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Earth Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from"
" earth attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce earth damage, "
"it does not make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Mind Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from "
"mind attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce mind damage, it "
"does not make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Body Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from "
"body attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce body damage, it "
"does not make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:26
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Skill points are awarded whenever your character trains for a new level.  "
"You can spend skill points on your skills at any time."
msgstr ""

