msgid "Casting cost 0 spell points.  Quickest recovery rate"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to fire by an amount equal to your"
" skill in Fire Magic and lasts one hour per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:7
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Launches a burst of fire at a single target.  Damage is 1-4 points of damage"
" per point of skill in Fire Magic, but casting cost is low.  Firebolt is "
"safe and effective—the “Old Reliable” of the Sorcerer’s arsenal."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:8
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Reduces the time it takes to recover from casting a spell or attacking with "
"a weapon.  Characters will be weak for six hours after this spell wears off."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:10
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Generates a ring of fire around the party that damages all monsters it "
"contacts.  Happily, Ring of Fire is safe and will not damage your own "
"characters.  Ring of Fire does six points of damage plus one per point of "
"skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:10
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Small radius of effect around party"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:10
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Larger radius"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:10
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Quicker recovery rate"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:11
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Launches streaks of fire in the direction the characters are facing.  The "
"bolts only hit monsters that stand in their way, so a little aiming practice"
" will help you get the most benefit from Fire Blast.  Fire Blast does 4 "
"points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:11
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow rate of recovery and 3 shots"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:11
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate rate of recovery and 5 shots"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:11
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Quick rate of recovery and 7 shots"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow rate of recovery and 8 meteors"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate rate of recovery and 12 meteors"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Quick rate of recovery and 16 meteors"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:16
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shows \"points of interest\""
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:17
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Static Chrg"
msgstr "Carga estática"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:17
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Targets a single monster with a jolt of static electricity.  It only does "
"2-6 points of damage, but it always hits.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:18
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Protection from Electricity"
msgstr "Protección contra la Electricidad"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:18
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to Electricity by an amount equal "
"to your skill in Air Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate, 7 sparks"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:23
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow recovery rate (faster for high skill ranking)"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:26
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Calls stars from the heavens to smite and burn your enemies.  Expert and "
"Master ranking in this spell both increase the number of stars called and "
"speed recovery.  The damage for each star is 20 points plus 1 per point of "
"skill in Air Magic, and Starburst only works outdoors.  Try not to get "
"caught in the blast…"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:26
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow recovery rate and 8 stars"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:26
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate and 12 stars"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:26
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate and 16 stars"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:29
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Targets a single monster with a field of extreme cold for an instant.  It "
"only does 2-6 points of damage, but it always hits.  The more skill you have"
" in Water Magic, the faster you will recover from casting Cold Beam.  "
"Masters of Water can cast this spell without cost."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:30
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to Cold by an amount equal to your"
" skill in Water Magic.  This spell lasts for one hour per point of skill in "
"Water Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Sprays poison at monsters directly in front of your characters.  Damage is "
"low, but few monsters have resistance to poison, so it usually works.  Each "
"shot does 2 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate recovery rate and 1 shot"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate and 3 shots"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate and 5 shots"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:33
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a single bolt of ice at a single target.  It always hits and does 1-7 "
"points of damage per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Gives a chance to imbue a normal item with magical powers.  The chance of "
"success is 10% per point of skill in Water Magic.  Experts manage better "
"enchantments, and only masters can enchant weapons."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Weak enchantments only"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Stronger enchantments"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Allows enchantment of weapons"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:35
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Acid burst squirts a jet of extremely caustic acid at a single victim.  It "
"always hits and does 9 points of damage plus 1-9 per point of skill.  The "
"big advantage of this spell is few monsters are resistant to acid."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Town Portal teleports the party to the central fountain of the last town "
"visited.  Town Portal has a 10% chance per point of Water Magic skill of "
"working when cast.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Outdoors only"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Indoors OK"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works anywhere and gives choice of destination"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:37
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a ball of ice in the direction the caster is facing.  The ball will "
"shatter when it hits something, launching 7 shards of ice in all directions "
"except the caster’s.  The shards will ricochet until they strike a creature "
"or melt.  Each shard does 12 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill in"
" Water Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:38
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Lloyd’s Beacon lets you place a marker at a location you want to teleport "
"back to in the future.  Just how far in the future depends on your skill and"
" ranking in Water Magic.  Cast this spell whenever you wish to either place "
"a marker or return to one.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:38
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "1 Beacon, decays in 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:38
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "3 Beacons, decays in 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:38
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "5 Beacons, decays in 1 week per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:41
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Creates and fires a single magical arrow.  Unlike most spells, this spell is"
" inaccurate and has the same chance of hitting as a regular arrow (using "
"your Earth Magic skill as a bonus to hit).  Also unlike most spells, Magic "
"Arrow is free to cast when you become a Master of Earth.  The arrow does 3-8"
" points of damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:42
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to magic by an amount equal to "
"your skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:43
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Summons a swarm of biting, stinging insects to bedevil a single target.  The"
" swarm only does 5 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Earth "
"Magic, but it never misses and the damage is physical, making resistance to "
"this spell unlikely."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:44
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases the armor class of a character by 5 + 1 point per point of skill "
"in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:45
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a rotating, razor-thin metal blade at a single monster.  This spell "
"can miss, and damage and chance to hit rely heavily on Earth Magic skill.  "
"The blade does 1-5 points of damage per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:46
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if stoned less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Turn - Stone"
msgstr "Convertir en piedra"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Temporarily turns a target to stone.  These stone statues are invulnerable "
"to any sort of attack."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 20 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a magical stone far into the air that creates a very large and "
"powerful explosion when it lands.  The damage is 20 points plus 1 per point "
"of skill in Earth Magic.  This spell can only be used outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery, larger radius of effect"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery, largest radius of effect"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:52
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires an ectoplasmic bolt of negative spiritual energy at a single target.  "
"Spirit arrow can miss, but a higher skill in Spirit Magic increases your "
"chances of hitting.  The arrow causes 1-6 points of damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:52
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate recovery"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:52
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Casting cost 0."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Healing"
msgstr "Curación"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cheaply heals a single character of 3-7 hit points.  Skill increases the "
"recovery rate of this spell."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heals 3-7 points of damage"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heals 5-9 points of damage"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heals 7-11 points of damage"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:55
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Temporarily increases a single character’s Luck statistic by 10 points plus "
"2 per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:55
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases luck by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:55
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases luck by 10 points plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if cursed less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Guard Angel"
msgstr "Ángel guardián"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Sets up a compact with the Higher Powers to resurrect your characters  and "
"return them to the last temple you visited upon their deaths.  The price for"
" this service is half of the gold your characters have with them at the time"
" of death.  Guardian Angel lasts for 1 hour per point of skill in Spirit "
"Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Characters are restored to life with 1 hit point each."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Characters are restored to life with half their hit points"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Characters are restored to life with all their hit points"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:58
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Heroism increases the damage a character does on a successful attack by 5 + "
"1 point per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:59
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Forces all visible undead monsters to flee until the duration of Turn Undead"
" runs out.  This spell lasts for 3 minutes plus 3 minutes per point of skill"
" in Spirit Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if dead less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if dead less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Shared Life combines the life force of your characters and redistributes it "
"amongst them as evenly as possible.  All current hit points are totaled and "
"1 extra point per point of skill in Spirit Magic is added to this total.  "
"Then the points are distributed back to the characters, with no individual "
"character being allowed to have more points than his maximum total hit "
"points."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Adds 1 hit point per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Adds 2 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:62
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Resurrects an eradicated (body destroyed) character if you cast this spell "
"in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the "
"condition could have been present before the “point of no return” is "
"reached.  After that, the only way to resurrect the character is to visit a "
"temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:62
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if eradicated less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:62
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if eradicated less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:62
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if eradicated less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Temporarily increases a single character’s Intellect and Personality "
"statistics by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases Intellect and Personality by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases Intellect and Personality by 10 points plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:66
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a bolt of mental force damaging to a single targets’ nervous system.  "
"Mind Blast does 5 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill in Mind "
"Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:67
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Temporarily increases a single character’s Accuracy statistic by 10 points "
"plus 2 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:67
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Accuracy by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:67
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Accuracy by 10 points plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Plyze"
msgstr "Curar parálisis"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if paralyzed less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:69
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 6 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:69
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 12 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:71
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Feeblemind removes the ability of a target to cast spells until this spell "
"wears out.  The duration of this spell is 5 minutes per point of skill in "
"Mind Magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:72
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if insane less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:72
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if insane less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Telekinesis lets you manipulate an object at a distance at a strength equal "
"to your character’s skill in Mind Magic.  Switches can be thrown, objects "
"picked up, and doors opened with this spell, all from a nice safe distance "
"from those nasty traps."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Strength of effect is 1 point per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Strength of effect is 2 points per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Strength of effect is 3 points per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures 5 hit points on a single target when cast.  Recovery is reduced by an "
"amount equal to the caster's skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 7 hit points"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 10 hit points"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:78
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to poison by an amount equal to "
"your skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:80
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Wound"
msgstr "Curar herida"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if poisoned less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:82
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Temporarily increases a single character’s Speed statistic by 10 points plus"
" 2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:82
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Speed by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:82
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Speed by 10 points plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if diseased less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if diseased less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:84
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Temporarily increases a single character’s Might and Endurance statistics by"
" 10 points plus 2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:84
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Might and Endurance by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:84
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Might and Endurance by 10 points plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:86
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures hit points of all characters in your party at once.  The number cured "
"is equal to 10 plus 2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Creates food for all of your characters if you have less real food than "
"would be created by this spell."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creates 1 day + 1 day per 10 points skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creates 1 day + 2 days per 10 points skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creates 1 day + 3 days per 10 points skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Gldn Touch"
msgstr "Toque dorado"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Converts a single item you select in your inventory into gold equal to 40% "
"of the item’s actual value.  There is a 10% chance per point of skill in "
"Light Magic that this spell will succeed.  If the spell fails, the item is "
"broken."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Converts item to 40% gold value"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Converts item to 60% gold value"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Converts item to 80% gold value"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Halves the walking speed and doubles the recovery rate of a single monster."
"  Slow makes sure a monster will attack you half as often, and will have a "
"harder time catching up to you if you choose to run.  The duration of this "
"spell is 3 minutes per point of skill in Light Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Simultaneously casts Power, Meditation, Speed, Lucky Day, Precision, and GA "
"on all your characters for one easy payment.   Day of the Gods is cast at "
"your skill in Light Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:95
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "All spells cast at twice skill in Light Magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:95
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Hour Power"
msgstr "Hora del Poder"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:95
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Simultaneously casts Haste, Heroism, Shield, Stone Skin, and Bless on all "
"your characters at your skill in Light Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:97
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Sun Ray is the second most devastating spell in Enroth, concentrating the "
"light of the sun on one unfortunate creature.  Since Sun Ray must focus the "
"light of the sun, it can only work outdoors and during the day.  Sun Ray "
"does 20 points of damage plus 1-20 per point of skill in Light Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:97
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Very slow recovery rate"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:98
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Once per day during the rising or setting of the sun, you may call upon the "
"heavens to heal your characters of all damage, restore your spell points, "
"and remove all adverse conditions.  The gods exact a price, however, aging "
"the caster 10 years for each Divine Intervention.  Recovery from this spell "
"is shortend with skill in Light Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:98
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Only works once per day"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:98
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Only works twice per day"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:98
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Only works three times per day"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:100
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Reanimate allows you to raise a lifeless creature from the dead (sort of).  "
"The spell does not make them grateful or peaceful in any way, but you can "
"always kill them again, if you want."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:100
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creature gets 10 hit points per skill point (up to creature's maximum)"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Inflicts the cursed condition on all monsters in the sight of the caster."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 2 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 4 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate recovery rate and 3 fragments"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate and 7 fragments"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Day of Prot"
msgstr "Día de Protección"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Simultaneously casts Protection from Fire, Electricity, Cold, Poison, and "
"Magic, plus Feather Fall and Wizard Eye on all your characters at your skill"
" in Dark Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "All spells cast at twice skill in Dark Magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Finger Death"
msgstr "Dedo de la Muerte"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Attempts to immediately slay a single creature by stripping its soul from "
"its body.  Finger of Death has a 3% chance per skill point in Dark Magic of "
"working, with Experts and Masters getting 4 and 5% chances respectively."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "3% chance of success per point of skill in Dark Magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "4% chance of success per point of skill in Dark Magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "5% chance of success per point of skill in Dark Magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:107
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"A powerful spell of Darkness, Moon Ray heals your characters and damages all"
" monsters in sight.  It doesn’t do a lot of damage or cure conditions, but "
"it is the only spell that harms all monsters in sight and works outside.  "
"Moon Ray is restricted to working outdoors and at night.  All monsters take "
"1-4 points of damage per point of skill in Dark Magic, and all characters "
"heal 1-4 points of damage per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:108
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Dragon Breath empowers the caster to exhale a cloud of toxic vapors that "
"target a single monster and damage all creatures nearby.  This spell is the "
"most powerful damage spell in the lands, doing 1-25 points of damage per "
"point of skill in Dark Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:109
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"This spell is the town killer.  It can only be cast once per day by "
"Apprentices to Dark Magic,  and only outdoors at that.  Armageddon inflicts "
"50 points of damage plus 1 point of damage for every point of Dark skill "
"your character has to every creature on the map, including all your "
"characters.   "
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:109
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Can only be cast once per day"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:109
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Can only be cast twice per day"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:110
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Dark Contain"
msgstr "Contención de Oscuridad"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:110
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"This spell attempts to trap the force of darkness into its victims, hence "
"the name Dark Containment.  The target of the spell will suffer from random "
"effects- though certain creatures are immune to this spell."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:3
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Intellect represents a character's ability to reason and understand complex,"
" abstract concepts.  A high intellect contributes to Sorcerer, Archer, and "
"Druid spell points"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:4
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Personality represents both a character's strength of will and personal "
"charm.  Clerics, Paladins, and Druids depend on personality for their spell "
"points."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:21
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Fire Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from "
"fire.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce fire damage, it does not "
"make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:22
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Electricity Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize "
"damage from electricity.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce "
"electricity damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:23
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Cold Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from "
"cold.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce cold damage, it does not "
"make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:24
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Poison"
msgstr "Veneno"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:24
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Poison Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage "
"from poison or acid.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce poison "
"damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:25
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Magic"
msgstr "Magia"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:25
msgctxt "stats"
msgid ""
"Magic Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from"
" magical attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce magic damage,"
" it does not make your character immune."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/STDITEMS.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Elec Resistance"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/STDITEMS.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "stditems"
msgid "of Elec Resistance"
msgstr "de Resistencia a la Electricidad"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/STDITEMS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Cold Resistance"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/STDITEMS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "stditems"
msgid "of Cold Resistance"
msgstr "de Resistencia al Frío"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/STDITEMS.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Poison Resistance"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/STDITEMS.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "stditems"
msgid "of Poison Resistance"
msgstr "de Resistencia al Veneno"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/USEITEMS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pure Intelect"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/USEITEMS.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "items"
